## Installation

### Prerequisites

- Node.js 18 or later
- npm or yarn package manager
- Cursor API key (`CURSOR_API_KEY` environment variable)

### Install via npm

```bash
npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code
```

### Verify Installation

```bash
claude --version
# Output: claude-code/1.x.x node-x.x.x win32-x64
```

### Authentication

```bash
# Set API key as environment variable
export CURSOR_API_KEY="cursor_abc123..."

# Or use cursor.com dashboard to generate a key
# Navigate to: https://cursor.com/dashboard/integrations
```

