## Core Commands

### Interactive Mode

```bash
# Start interactive session
claude

# With a specific prompt
claude "Refactor src/auth.ts to use JWT tokens"

# Plan-only mode (no file edits, just analysis)
claude --plan "How should I migrate this database schema?"

# With a file as context
claude src/auth.ts "Review this authentication module"

# With multiple files
claude src/auth.ts src/middleware.ts "Analyze the auth flow"
```

### One-Shot Mode

```bash
# Generate output and exit
claude "Write a function that validates email addresses" > output.txt

# Pipe input
echo "Fix the bug in src/utils.ts line 42" | claude

# Generate a file
claude "Create a README.md for this project"
```

### Session Management

```bash
# Resume a previous session
claude --resume <agent-id>

# List active sessions
claude --list

# Force a new session (no resume)
claude --no-resume "Start a fresh task"

# Set a session timeout (hours)
claude --session-timeout 2
```

