## Command Flags Reference

### General Flags

| Flag | Description | Example |
|------|-------------|---------|
| `--plan` | Plan-only mode, no file edits | `claude --plan "Analyze code quality"` |
| `--resume` | Resume a previous agent session | `claude --resume bc-abc123` |
| `--no-resume` | Start a fresh session, don't resume | `claude --no-resume "New task"` |
| `--list` | List active agent sessions | `claude --list` |
| `--output` | Output format | `claude --output json "Query the database"` |
| `--log` | Log file path | `claude --log /tmp/claude.log "Fix bug"` |
| `--session-timeout` | Session duration in hours | `claude --session-timeout 4` |

### Git Integration Flags

| Flag | Description | Example |
|------|-------------|---------|
| `--edit` | Edit files with agent assistance | `claude --edit src/index.ts` |
| `--review` | Review staged changes | `claude --review` |
| `--commit` | Generate and apply commit message | `claude --commit "fix: resolve auth bug"` |
| `--amend` | Amend last commit with agent help | `claude --amend` |

### CI/CD Flags

| Flag | Description | Example |
|------|-------------|---------|
| `--headless` | Non-interactive mode for CI | `claude --headless "Run tests and fix failures"` |
| `--yes` | Auto-accept all changes | `claude --yes --headless "Fix lint errors"` |
| `--dry-run` | Show changes without applying | `claude --dry-run --headless "Refactor utils"` |
| `--max-turns` | Limit conversation turns | `claude --max-turns 10 --headless "Debug"` |

