## Git Integration

### Code Review

```bash
# Review uncommitted changes
claude --review

# Review specific file
claude --review src/auth.ts

# Review staged changes
claude --staged --review

# Review with specific focus areas
claude --review "Focus on security vulnerabilities and error handling"
```

### Automated Commit Messages

```bash
# Generate commit message from staged changes
claude --commit

# Generate and apply
git add .
claude --commit -m "$(claude --commit-message)"

# Conventional commits format
claude --commit --conventional
```

### Edit Mode

```bash
# Open a file for agent-assisted editing
claude --edit src/user-service.ts

# Edit with a specific task
claude --edit src/auth.ts "Add rate limiting to login endpoint"

# Edit multiple files
claude --edit src/auth.ts src/middleware.ts "Standardize error handling"
```

### Amend Commits

```bash
# Review last commit and suggest improvements
claude --amend

# Amend with agent-generated changes
claude --amend "Also fix the import order"
```

