### Feature Parity

| Feature | Editor Agent | Claude Code CLI |
|---------|-------------|-----------------|
| File read/write | Full editor diff views | Direct file system operations |
| Shell execution | Terminal tool | Shell tool (same) |
| Agent subtasks | Task subagents | Task subagents (same types) |
