## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

| Issue | Cause | Solution |
|-------|-------|----------|
| `CURSOR_API_KEY not set` | Missing authentication | Set `CURSOR_API_KEY` environment variable |
| `Model not found` | Invalid model ID | Use `claude --model auto` or check available models |
| `Exit code 1` | Startup failure (auth/config/network) | Verify API key, check network connectivity |
| `Exit code 2` | Run failed mid-execution | Check log file, review tool outputs |
| `Interactive prompt in CI` | Missing `--headless` flag | Add `--headless --yes` flags |
| `Too many turns` | Session exceeded `--max-turns` | Increase `--max-turns` or scope the task |
| `Slow completions` | Large context or network latency | Close irrelevant files, use faster model |
| `File not found` | Wrong working directory | Run from the project root or pass explicit file paths |

### Diagnostic Commands

```bash
# Check version and environment
claude --version
claude --env

# List active sessions
claude --list

# Test API connectivity
claude --dry-run "Explain who you are"

# View last session logs
cat /tmp/claude-ci.log
```

### Log Locations

| Platform | Default Log Location |
|----------|---------------------|
| Linux | `~/.cursor/claude-code/logs/` |
| macOS | `~/Library/Logs/claude-code/` |
| Windows | `%APPDATA%\claude-code\logs\` |

